---
title: "07 - Sequence Diagram Login"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Pengguna
    participant V as Browser/View
    participant A as AuthController
    participant M as User Model
    participant DB as Database (users)

    P->>V: Akses halaman /login
    V->>A: GET /login
    A-->>V: Tampilkan view&lt;br/&gt;formulir login
    P->>V: Isi email &amp; password
    P->>V: Klik tombol Login
    V->>A: POST /login (email, password)
    A->>A: Validasi formulir&lt;br/&gt;(FormRequest)
    A->>M: Auth::attempt(credentials)
    M->>DB: SELECT * FROM users&lt;br/&gt;WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>M: User data
    M-->>A: Boolean (valid/invalid)

    alt Kredensial valid
        A->>A: Buat session
        A-->>V: Redirect ke&lt;br/&gt;Dashboard sesuai role
        V-->>P: Tampilkan Dashboard
    else Kredensial invalid
        A-->>V: Redirect back&lt;br/&gt;+ error message
        V-->>P: Tampil pesan&lt;br/&gt;'Email/password salah'
    end
